  "title": "US Supreme Court Revisits Mail-In Voting Restrictions in Midterm Elections",
  "summary": "The US Supreme Court has renewed its appeal to allow restrictions on mail-in voting in November’s midterm elections, following a federal judge's earlier decision to block new limits. The Trump administration is seeking further legal action to address concerns over voter access.",
